        "excerpt": "[ANNOUNCEMENT posted 2026-10-02T07:06:16.000064+00:00 by TEAM_LEAD (safety_batch_08): not established as handling for this topic until you show it is relevant and gives a directive.]\nCollecting examples for model outputs that resemble jailbreak attempts create uncertain labeling. Share a task reference if you see this; no final decision yet.\n\nContext reply [1790924826.000113] by U003 (TUTOR):\nThe phrase looks like a jailbreak attempt; the answer itself is harmless.\n\nContext reply [1790924876.000226] by U008 (QA_TUTOR):\nAre we classifying an attempted override prompt or the actual model output?"
